  "content": "<h1>东方女仆</h1><p>这是一个Minecraft 1.16.5-1.20.1的Forge模组，灵感来源于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fLittle_Maid_Mob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a>模组和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">东方Project</a>。<br>\n模组添加了可爱的女仆到Minecraft中，她们能帮助你战斗、耕种以及完成其他任务。<br>\n本模组支持基岩版实体格式的自定义模型，你可以轻松切换女仆模型，或创建属于自己的女仆模型。</p><h2>图片</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4ddb34836457d9b4daf1f72bd0f7cdad0da0953d.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eea50440aeeb0bea18858ee6afbf362a8f0f53e7.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8523790ba7c7abf66ba5cc315f6699277bf97761.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7493a33b9330b78b1ba228a1808d6d11a878635f.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\"></p><h3>视频</h3><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f1RlsOLinuis\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1RlsOLinuis</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fxKowWaJCIYA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xKowWaJCIYA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除： <a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f8Eo2GM-a7iA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8Eo2GM-a7iA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><h2>注意事项</h2><ul>\n<li>如果有任何意见或建议，可以访问<a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">讨论区</a>向我们反馈。</li>\n<li>如果遇到任何bug，可以访问<a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题区</a>提交问题。</li>\n<li>你可以访问<a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">发布页</a>下载快照版本模组，但请注意<strong>快照版本模组会非常不稳定</strong>。</li>\n</ul><h2>作者</h2><ul>\n<li>程序员：<code>TartaricAcid</code>、<code>Snownee</code></li>\n<li>美术：<code>Succinum</code>、<code>Pajinyi</code>、<code>ZeniCrow</code>、<code>Tian_mi</code>、<code>Paulzzh</code>、<code>YurisCat</code></li>\n</ul><h2>致谢</h2><ul>\n<li>MMM和Verclene：制作了<a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a>模组</li>\n<li>ZUN：制作了<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">东方Project</a></li>\n<li>声音资源来自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww14.big.or.jp%252f%257eamiami%252fhappy%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">あみたろの声素材工房</a></li>\n<li>LittleMaid PEKO音效：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://booth.pm/ja/items/1903163&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>五子棋AI：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/anlingyi/xechat-idea&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>以及其他以任何方式帮助过我的玩家，还有你</li>\n</ul><h2>支持多种AI框架的女仆AI聊天：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplayer2.game%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player2</a></li>\n<li>OpenAI</li>\n</ul><h2>许可证</h2><ul>\n<li>代码：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mit.edu%252f%257eamini%252fLICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a></li>\n<li>资源：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></li>\n</ul>",
